<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>MT5 Competition Signal Desk</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="desk">

    <header class="desk__header">
      <div class="desk__brand">
        <span class="desk__mark">CMP</span>
        <div>
          <h1>Competition Signal Desk</h1>
          <p id="pair-line">XAU/USD &middot; 15min &middot; manual signals, not an EA</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="desk__pulse" id="pulse">
        <span class="pulse__dot"></span>
        <span id="pulse-text">connecting</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="disclaimer">
      This tool suggests signals only — every trade must be placed by hand in MT5. It has no connection to your broker account,
      so it can't see your real floating P&amp;L. You're responsible for watching your own open positions against the daily
      5%-including-floating-losses rule yourself.
    </div>

    <main class="desk__grid">
      <section class="panel panel--price">
        <div class="panel__label">Last price</div>
        <div class="price" id="price">&mdash;</div>
        <svg id="spark" class="spark" viewBox="0 0 400 90" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg>
        <div class="price__meta" id="checked-at">waiting for first check&hellip;</div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel panel--signal" id="signal-panel">
        <div class="panel__label">Latest signal</div>
        <div class="signal" id="signal-word">NONE</div>
        <div class="signal__targets" id="signal-targets"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel panel--readout">
        <div class="panel__label">Readout</div>
        <dl class="readout">
          <div><dt>RSI (14)</dt><dd id="rsi-val">&mdash;</dd></div>
          <div><dt>EMA 9</dt><dd id="ema-fast">&mdash;</dd></div>
          <div><dt>EMA 21</dt><dd id="ema-slow">&mdash;</dd></div>
          <div><dt>ATR (14)</dt><dd id="atr-val">&mdash;</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="panel panel--history">
        <div class="panel__label">Signal history</div>
        <ul class="history" id="history-list">
          <li class="history__empty">No signals fired yet.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>

    <section class="compwrap">
      <div class="panel__label">Competition compliance</div>

      <div class="riskbanner" id="comp-banner" style="display:none;"></div>

      <div class="compgrid">
        <div class="compcol">
          <div class="risklabel">Daily P&amp;L <span id="comp-daily-limit"></span></div>
          <div class="riskbar"><div class="riskbar__fill" id="comp-daily-fill"></div></div>
          <div class="riskvalue" id="comp-daily-value">$0.00</div>
        </div>
        <div class="compcol">
          <div class="risklabel">Total P&amp;L <span id="comp-total-limit"></span></div>
          <div class="riskbar"><div class="riskbar__fill" id="comp-total-fill"></div></div>
          <div class="riskvalue" id="comp-total-value">$0.00</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="compmeta" id="comp-meta">&mdash;</div>

      <div class="riskactions">
        <button class="riskbtn riskbtn--ghost" id="btn-reset-day">Reset day</button>
        <button class="riskbtn riskbtn--ghost" id="btn-reset-competition">Reset competition</button>
      </div>

      <div class="panel__label" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Open positions (manual)</div>
      <ul class="positions" id="positions-list">
        <li class="positions__empty">No open positions.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="panel__label" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Trade log</div>
      <ul class="risklog" id="comp-log"></ul>
    </section>

    <footer class="desk__footer">
      Signals are suggestions only — place every trade yourself in MT5. Not an Expert Advisor. Not financial advice.
    </footer>

  </div>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
